              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "An expense? (ಖರ್ಚು, kharcu.) Insurance? (ವಿಮೆ, vime.) A queue? (ಸಾಲು, sālu.) Experience? (ಅನುಭವ, anubhava.) A resignation? (ರಾಜೀನಾಮೆ, rājīnāme.) Groceries? (ದಿನಸಿ, dinasi.) Profit? (ಲಾಭ, lābha.) A loss? (ನಷ್ಟ, naṣṭa.) Science? (ವಿಜ್ಞಾನ, vijñāna.) History? (ಇತಿಹಾಸ, itihāsa.) Staff? (ಸಿಬ್ಬಂದಿ, sibbandi.) An employee? (ನೌಕರ, naukara.) Attendance? (ಹಾಜರಿ, hājari.) A work shift? (ಪಾಳಿ, pāḷi.) An advance? (ಮುಂಗಡ, muṅgaḍa.)"
